THOUGHT: The staged checks require a broad shared-state service, and the environment has no web frameworks. I’ll now create a standard-library implementation using SQLite for cross-node persistence, threaded HTTP servers on all three ports, a minimal WebSocket implementation with durable per-channel events, and the core auth/workspace/channel/message/profile/reaction APIs. I’ll also add the required foreground supervisor script.

